    </p><a href="/">← Home</a><pagefind-searchbox></pagefind-searchbox><script type="module" src="/pagefind/pagefind-component-ui.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="/static/pagefind.js"></script><h1 class="instruction-section" data-pagefind-body="1" data-pagefind-weight="10" data-pagefind-sort="title">LDARB</h1><p class="insn_subtitle" data-pagefind-body="1">Load-acquire register byte</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">This instruction derives an address from a base register value,
loads a byte from memory, zero-extends it and writes it to a register.</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1"><span class="asm-code">LDARB</span> loads from memory with Acquire semantics.</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">For more information about memory ordering semantics, see <a class="armarm-xref" title="Reference to Armv8 ARM section" data-linkend="BEIHCHEF">Load-Acquire, Load-AcquirePC, and Store-Release</a>.</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">For information about addressing modes, see
<a class="armarm-xref" title="Reference to Armv8 ARM section" data-linkend="CHDIIIBB">Load/Store addressing modes</a>.</p>
    
    <p class="desc"></p><div class="regdiagram-32"><table class="regdiagram"><thead><tr><td>31</td><td>30</td><td>29</td><td>28</td><td>27</td><td>26</td><td>25</td><td>24</td><td>23</td><td>22</td><td>21</td><td>20</td><td>19</td><td>18</td><td>17</td><td>16</td><td>15</td><td>14</td><td>13</td><td>12</td><td>11</td><td>10</td><td>9</td><td>8</td><td>7</td><td>6</td><td>5</td><td>4</td><td>3</td><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>0</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="firstrow"><td class="l">0</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="l">0</td><td class="r">0</td><td class="lr">1</td><td class="lr">0</td><td class="lr">0</td><td class="l">0</td><td class="r">1</td><td class="lr">1</td><td class="lr">0</td><td class="l">(1)</td><td>(1)</td><td>(1)</td><td>(1)</td><td class="r">(1)</td><td class="lr">1</td><td class="l">(1)</td><td>(1)</td><td>(1)</td><td>(1)</td><td class="r">(1)</td><td colspan="5" class="lr">Rn</td><td colspan="5" class="lr">Rt</td></tr><tr class="secondrow"><td colspan="2" class="droppedname">size</td><td colspan="2"></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td colspan="2"></td><td class="droppedname">L</td><td></td><td colspan="5" class="droppedname">Rs</td><td class="droppedname">o0</td><td colspan="5" class="droppedname">Rt2</td><td colspan="5"></td><td colspan="5"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="encoding"><div class="encoding__label"><h4 class="encoding">Encoding</h4><a id="LDARB_LR32_ldstord"></a></div><p class="asm-code">LDARB  <a href="#WtOrWZR__4" title='Is the 32-bit name of the general-purpose register to be transferred, encoded in the "Rt" field.'>&lt;Wt&gt;</a>, [<a href="#XnSP_option" title='Is the 64-bit name of the general-purpose base register or stack pointer, encoded in the "Rn" field.'>&lt;Xn|SP&gt;</a>{, #0}]</p></div><h4>Decode</h4><p class="pseudocode">let t : integer{} = UInt(Rt);
let n : integer{} = UInt(Rn);

let acquire : boolean = TRUE;
let tagchecked : boolean = n != 31;</p>
